      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "冷静になって考えれば、個人的な願いで女王陛下の\nお手を煩わせてしまい、無礼千万、恐悦至極です！\nしかしお優しい陛下のお陰で、妹の部隊は気力充填、\n次にモーザ軍と戦う時は、秒で蹴散らしてみせます！",
        "official_en": "In hindsight, I realize how rude it was to bother Your\nMajesty with my request. But your generosity means\nthat my sister's squad is in high spirits, and stands\nready to scatter the Mosa in their next battle!",
        "real_en": null
      },
